{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIzL1RoZSUyMEdyZWF0JTIwVHVya2V5JTIwVG93biUyME1pcmFjbGUlMjAlMjgyMDIzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"The Great Turkey Town Miracle","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zWBWN84pFibFAe9w0ePpOx8QYQb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kDM5muBxp0AvzP7PrZOxLaI9UC7.jpg","description":"Widowed morning-drive DJ Connor McCloud's radio station has been sold and as there's no longer a need for a morning drive DJ, he is let go. With two teenage daughters, Connor must start looking for new employment immediately. With good jobs few and far between, especially for a middle-aged DJ, he meets Ethan, a believing homeless man who encourages him and after many failed job interviews, miraculously, the House of Hope, a busy homeless shelter, hires Connor to be their Procurement Director. His first assignment? To obtain 4,000 frozen turkeys for needy families on Thanksgiving Day, just one month away! One thing is certain: he will require a miracle to pull this off.\n\nReleased 10 Nov 2023 · United States of America · Language: English · 83 min\nStudio: LAMA Entertainment, Bridge and Acorn Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Family","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"83 min","cast":["Cameron Arnett","Corey Cannon","Angus Benfield","Sharon Oliphant","Emma Donovan-Mendenhall","Melissa Blanco","Jessica Rae"],"director":["Angus Benfield"],"released":"2023-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Five loaves. Two Fish. Four thousand turkeys.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Angus Benfield","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/v8xaNtdgIVNJEhjWyc7soJeKAWH.jpg"},{"name":"Cameron Arnett","character":"Ethan Magus","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r9JFN7CyYzybehriG8vB0F7280n.jpg"},{"name":"Corey Cannon","character":"Billy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sIuYou1Mrabi8ilhav6MBd7APED.jpg"},{"name":"Angus Benfield","c